  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Protocol layer:\n      - Implemented \"Zero-Allocation\" pipeline for HTTP and WebSocket protocols using Span-based processing and static resource caching.\n      - Neutralized memory churn by replacing string literals with pre-allocated ByteString and ReadOnlySpan<byte> constants (StorageData).\n      - Optimized Static Content Delivery: High-speed route lookup and response retrieval from FileCache with 0% heap allocation on the hotpath.\n      - Enhanced Handshake Efficiency: Transitioned WebSocket/HTTP upgrade logic to use stackalloc and System.Buffers.Text for Base64/SHA1 operations, eliminating intermediate string garbage.\n      - Refactored Error Handling: Cached all protocol-level error messages to ensure zero allocation even during high-frequency invalid request attempts (Anti-DoS).\n      - Integrated Utf8Map for near-instant, allocation-free header and path mapping, significantly reducing GC pressure under heavy load.",
